WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.738
Module 2 is the target PKI.

2
00:00:02.738 --> 00:00:05.812
There's no single replacement for AD CS.

3
00:00:05.812 --> 00:00:10.984
The target is four issuers, each
serving what only it can: Cloud PKI,

4
00:00:10.984 --> 00:00:14.719
a smaller hardened AD CS,
the Federal PKI for PIV,

5
00:00:14.719 --> 00:00:20.040
and public CAs, with one lifecycle
platform holding them together.
